{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1537789-phrases-for-the-oracles","id":1537789,"title":"Phrases For The Oracles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-06-21T22:55:56-07:00","id":1537789,"title":"Phrases For The Oracles","content":"<i>Signs of Sorcery </i>\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200band the Order book for the Silver Ladder states that the SL that the Oracles are not only the &quot;good&quot; counterparts of the Exarchs but that they created the Watchtowers and the Paths themselves <br /> They are<br /> Acanthus; The Youthful King of Thorns Mastigos; The King of the Burning Voice<br /> Moros; The Sorrowful King in Gray<br /> Obrimos; The Star-Cloaked King of Thunder<br /> Thyrsus; The Throneless King of the Heart<br /> <br /> From <i>sig</i><i>ns<br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b</i><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Oracles, then, are the missing \u201cgood Exarchs,\u201d the wise Kings of Atlantis who made it possible for humans to Awaken even through their counterparts\u2019 Lie. </div> </div> </div>While I'm aware that this is &quot;'&quot;&quot;&quot;just &quot;&quot;'&quot;&quot;&quot; the beliefs of the Silver Ladder and that the Oracles may not exist,<br /> Let's assume that they do,even if their precise nature is unknown,what would they say? Now granted they as the antithesis of the Exarchs don't really meddle in people's lives which might preclude speaking to them, then again... Things change, revolutions happen ...and they tend to end badly for Tyrants<br /> In the vein of the awesome <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1498506-phrases-for-the-exarchs/page2\">thread about the Exarchs</a><br /> \u200b\u200b\u200bwhat do you think The Oracles say/what phrases do you associate with them\u200b?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-21T23:03:43-07:00","id":1537790,"title":"","content":"&quot;y'know, Folx like to call me Throneless, some say it as a compliment and others say it as mockery. The truth is that it's neither, it's simply a statement of fact. I'm Throneless and I've seen a time coming very shortly where everyone else will be too&quot;<br /> Thyrsus<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-29T21:05:26-07:00","id":1537889,"title":"","content":"If you consider the Watchtowers as being the embodiment of their philosophies of magic, then I would choose the following quotes for each of them:<br /> <br /> <b>The Youthful King of Thorns:</b> <i>&quot;Write your story as it needs to be written. Write it honestly, and tell it as best you can. I\u2019m not sure that there are any other rules. Not ones that matter.&quot;</i> (quote by Neil Gaiman).<br /> <br /> <b>The King of the Burning Voice:</b> <i>&quot;Many people dedicate their lives to actualizing a concept of what they should be like, rather than actualizing themselves.<br /> This difference between self-actualization and self-image actualization is very important. Most people live only for their image.&quot;</i> (quote by Bruce Lee).<br /> <br /> <b>The Sorrowful King in Gray:</b> <i>&quot;Think of yourself as dead. You have lived your life. Now, take what's left and live it properly.&quot;</i> (quote by Marcus Aurelius).<br /> <br /> <b>The Star-Cloaked King of Thunder:</b> <i>&quot;Our greatest glory is not in never falling, but in rising every time we fall.&quot;</i> (quote by Confucius)\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>The Throneless King of the Heart:</b> <i>\u201cCommon sense is instinct. Enough of it is genius.\u201d </i>(quote by George Bernard Shaw).\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-29T21:59:27-07:00","id":1537891,"title":"","content":"Thanks Kaiser","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}